*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol/string_concat
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRCAT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FIRST  PIC X(10) VALUE "Hello".
01 WS-SECOND PIC X(10) VALUE "World".
01 WS-RESULT PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    STRING WS-FIRST DELIMITED BY SPACE
           " "      DELIMITED BY SIZE
           WS-SECOND DELIMITED BY SPACE
           INTO WS-RESULT.
    DISPLAY WS-RESULT.
    STOP RUN.

